# Shrishti Dairy Farm — Laravel + React

## Backend (Laravel API + admin)
Copy `backend/.env.example` to `backend/.env` and set PostgreSQL:

```
DB_CONNECTION=pgsql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=5432
DB_DATABASE=shrishti_dairy
DB_USERNAME=shrishti
DB_PASSWORD=shrishti
```

Or use Docker: `docker compose up -d`

Then:
```
cd backend
php artisan key:generate
php artisan migrate --seed
php artisan serve
```

Admin: http://localhost:8000/admin

## Frontend (Vite React)
```
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

Storefront: http://localhost:5173 (API proxied to Laravel)

Optional `frontend/.env`:
```
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
```
Leave empty to use the Vite dev proxy (`/api` → `http://127.0.0.1:8000`).
